  "_comment": "Data-driven settings screen (docs/HudSystem.md \u00a711a). Loaded by UI::loadGameScreenInto(ui,\"settings\",...). Two columns. slider/checkbox/dropdown carry a numeric \"setting\" key (MenuActions.onGetSetting/onSetSetting); textinput carries a string \"setting\" key (onGetSettingText/onSetSettingText). Back = action \"back\". The 'keybindings' sub-panel (open via open_submenu) has one row per action: a label + a key button (action {type:rebind, binding:<Action>}) showing {{keybind.<Action>}}; host wires onRebindKey (key capture). Changes apply live; host saves on Back.",
